"Moist Air Cooling Coil Calculation

Air at 32 C and 40% relative humidity is cooled to 20 C by passing over a cooling
battery with a mean surface temperature of 5 C (air pressure 1 bar).
Calculate:
  - The total heat extracted from the air
  - The sensible and latent heat components
  - The condensed water vapor per kg of dry air
"

T_su=32 "[°C]" "!!"
RH_su=0.4
T_ex=20
T_c=5
P=1E5 "[Pa]"

"contact effectiveness (NTU method)"

epsilon_c=(T_su-T_ex)/(T_su-T_c)
w_su=humrat(airH2O,T=T_su,R=RH_su,P=P) "[kg eau/kg air sec]"

RH_c=1
w_c=humrat(airH2O,T=T_c,R=RH_c,P=P)

"outlet humidity calculation"
epsilon_c=(w_su-w_ex)/(w_su-w_c)

"total heat extracted"
q=h_su-h_ex
h_su=ENTHALPY(AirH2O,T=T_su,P=P,w=w_su)
h_ex=ENTHALPY(AirH2O,T=T_ex,P=P,w=w_ex)

"sensible heat"
q_s=h_su_air-h_ex_air
h_su_air=ENTHALPY(Air,T=T_su)
h_ex_air=ENTHALPY(Air,T=T_ex)

"latent heat"
q_l=(w_su-w_ex)*L_fg "[J/kg]"
L_fg=2500000 "[J/kg]"

"condensed water quantity [kg/kg dry air]"
DELTAw=w_su-w_ex

T[1]=T_su
T[2]=T_ex
T[3]=T_c
w[1]=w_su
w[2]=w_ex
w[3]=w_c